---
import "@styles/global.module.css";
import Header from "@components/header.astro";
import Scripts from "@components/scripts.astro";
import Footer from "@components/footer.astro";
import Meta from "@components/meta.astro";
import Cursor from "@components/cursor.astro";
import Tabs from "@components/Tabs.astro";
import Tab from "@components/Tab.astro";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <style>
        .warning {
            background-color: rgb(75, 75, 0);
            padding: 0.5em;
            margin: 0.5em;
            border: 2px solid gray;
            border-top: 2px solid lightgray;
            border-left: 2px solid lightgray;
        }
    </style>
    <Meta name="AkaBot" description="A Discord bot by Lunya"/>
    <Scripts/>
    <Cursor/>
</head>

<body>
<canvas id="background"></canvas>

<!-- God damnit, I'm forced to use inline styles because Astro is stupid -->
<div style="position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;">
    <Header/>
    <main>
        <h1>Akabot</h1>
        <Tabs>
            <Tab href="/project/akabot" selected>About</Tab>
            <Tab href="/project/akabot/privacy">Privacy Policy</Tab>
            <Tab href="/project/akabot/tos">Terms of Service</Tab>
            <Tab href="/project/akabot/changelog">Changelog</Tab>
            <Tab href="https://git.lunya.pet/Lunya/Akabot/wiki">Documentation</Tab>
        </Tabs>
        <p>A verified Discord bot by Lunya, filled to the brim with cool features, all for free of charge.</p>

        <div>
            <a href="https://discord.com/api/oauth2/authorize?client_id=1172922944033411243&permissions=2048&scope=bot">
                <button>Invite</button>
            </a>
            <a href="https://discord.gg/YFksXpXnn6">
                <button>Support Discord</button>
            </a>
            <a href="https://git.lunya.pet/Lunya/Akabot">
                <button>GitLab (mld's instance)</button>
            </a>
            <a href="https://git.lunya.pet/Lunya/Akabot">
                <button>GitHub</button>
            </a>
            <a href="https://codeberg.org/LunyaUwU/Akabot">
                <button>Codeberg</button>
            </a>
            <a href="https://git.gay/mld/Akabot">
                <button>Git.gay</button>
            </a>
        </div>

        <div>
            <a href="https://git.gay/mld/Akabot">
                <img src="/buttons/gitgay.svg" alt="Git.gay 88x31 button">
            </a>
        </div>

        <p>The support Discord has active updates about the development of the bot, a chatting community and even you
            can be part of the development by suggesting new features!</p>
        <p>This Discord bot provides numerous features to enrich your server experience. Below is a simple explanation
            of what this bot offers:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Anti Raid:</strong> Detects big
                join waves and kicks members accordingly.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Chat Revive:</strong> Revives
                chat if it has been dead for a while.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Chat Streaks:</strong>
                Encourages activity by counting consecutively sent messages.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Chat Summary:</strong> Every
                UTC midnight it summarizes the amount of messages sent in chats.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Leveling:</strong> Counts XP from
                messages, calculate levels and give rewards for levels.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Logging:</strong> Logs different
                events.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Moderation:</strong> Commands
                for kicking, banning and muting people, with DM’s.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Reaction Roles:</strong>
                Buttons for creating reaction roles, with different behavior settings.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Welcome and Goodbye:</strong> Say welcome and say goodbye to members who join or leave.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Giveaways:</strong> Host simple
                giveaways on your Discord server, with any ending date and custom reward.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Automod Actions:</strong>
                Perform actions when an automod rule is triggered.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Temporary VC's</strong> - Create unlimited voice channels without needing admins to help.
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p>If you think that any features are missing from the bot, you can suggest them straight from the bot using
            <code>/feedback suggest</code>. They will be added if they're good.</p>
    </main>
    <Footer/>
</div>
<script is:inline defer src="/scripts/background.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
